        "collapsible_14": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Description",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Milk thistle is a plant-based supplement known for its active compound silymarin, which supports liver function, reduced fatigue, and many other health benefits.†</p><p>Our science-backed 80% silymarin formula pairs Milk Thistle with Inositol and Turmeric to support your liver, reduce bloating and give you steady energy.†</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_15": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why You Need Milk Thistle?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Your liver filters everything you eat, drink and breathe. When it's overworked, you feel it: bloating, low energy, brain fog and dull skin. Milk Thistle gives it the daily support it needs.†</p><p>It's made for both men and women, and you don't need to overhaul your diet or quit drinking. Healthy habits always help, but it's designed to fit into your routine as-is.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_21": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "About Your Free Gifts",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Liver Reset Guide</strong> – a 30-day plan of simple liver-friendly meals and habits.</p><p><strong>Anti-Bloat Blueprint</strong> – practical tips to reduce bloating and support digestion.</p><p>Free items are digital and delivered by email with your first order.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_16": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Benefits",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Liver support</strong> — helps protect and support healthy liver function†</li><li><strong>Digestion</strong> — lighter digestion and less bloating†</li><li><strong>Energy &amp; clarity</strong> — steadier energy, reduced brain fog†</li><li><strong>Glowing skin</strong> — clearer skin and stronger hair over time†</li></ul><p><strong>When will I see results?</strong> Days 1 to 14: lighter digestion and steadier energy. Week 3 to 6: clearer skin, less brain fog. Month 2+: your liver is supported, and you feel transformed.†</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_17": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Recommended Use",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Take 1 capsule daily with water, preferably with a meal. Morning is best for a strong start to your day, and taking it at the same time each day keeps your system balanced.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_22": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do You Offer a Guarantee?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Every order is protected by our 90-day money-back guarantee. If you don't feel lighter, clearer, and more energized, we'll refund every cent.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        }
